# Project 05 - Quiz Engine

Console quiz program written in Python.

## Idea
A basic terminal application that lets users select quiz topics, answer multiple-choice questions, and get a report at the end.

## Features
- Over 15 questions categorized by topic
- Topic filter or full mixed test options
- Input validation (accepts A, B, C, D)
- Score calculation with topic breakdown
- Retake option at the end

## How to run
Just execute the Python script from the terminal:
python "project 5.py"

(The run_quiz() function is called at the bottom of the file, so it starts automatically).

## What We learned
- Organizing logic into functions
- Working with lists and dictionaries to hold question data
- Handling invalid user input smoothly
